    description: "DEEP bakeoff (60 repos) shows HIGH_ORPHAN_RATE in 6 repos: ffmpeg (31%), postgresql (22%), kbuild (27%), qemu-ipxe (43%), rabbitmq (47%), dmd (46%). These repos have many symbols not connected to any call edges. Possible causes: (1) C/C++ function pointer calls not resolved, (2) Erlang message-passing not creating call edges, (3) D language method calls not resolved, (4) genuinely isolated utility functions. Investigate whether orphan reduction is possible via improved call resolution."  # 0861
